---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Plumba"
  description="How this Plumba website handles information while you explore the project."
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-[calc(100%-40px)] max-w-[760px] pt-10 pb-16 min-[601px]:w-[calc(100%-64px)] min-[601px]:pt-16">
    <header class="mb-10 border-b border-border pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight min-[601px]:text-4xl">
        Privacy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        A simple website for a project being built in the open.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="space-y-9 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:leading-7 [&_p]:mt-3 [&_p]:max-w-[65ch] [&_p]:leading-7 [&_p]:text-muted-foreground">
      <div>
        <h2>Browsing this website</h2>
        <p>
          You can explore Plumba without creating an account. This version of
          the website has no signup form, advertising cookies, or third party
          analytics.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Technical requests</h2>
        <p>
          Your browser requests pages, fonts, and other files from the server
          that hosts this website. Those requests can include your IP address,
          browser information, and the page that referred you here. Any server
          logging depends on how the website is hosted.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>
          Some links take you to GitHub or another external website. Those
          services have their own privacy policies and handle information
          independently of this website.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Questions about the project</h2>
        <p>
          Visit the{' '}
          <a
            class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            href="https://github.com/theobiabo/plumba"
          >
            Plumba repository
          </a>
          for the current project information. Avoid sharing personal
          information in public issues or discussions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        class="inline-block text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring"
        href="/"
      >
        Back to Plumba
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
